{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S01、S05 等段落的小感受词仍然偏密，纵向交替阅读不如 Y 的左右分栏省力；但 X 的重点加亮和音乐节点分批出现，缓解了不少信息拥挤。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 更能让人感到这是一段随音乐逐步展开的完整心理历程：加亮的关键词让关键心意容易被抓住，反复出现的水面、船、摇荡等意象也把前后串了起来。尤其是标记为到时出现的感受，能够跟着音乐逐步呈现，让情绪变化有细微的层次，而不是一次性堆在屏幕上。Y 的左右分栏确实更容易扫读，叙述也更口语顺畅，但它压缩了一些重要的心理转折和音乐细节，整体体验不如 X 丰富。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7f765e68-fd95-4ec6-9160-34abade94752", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T231648030739Z", "elapsed_seconds": 103.421, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:18:31.457507+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "96530c89d896b75a1237a21773a46f7ea10a696e07c79d98f5524bb19840368a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c